[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938467254","pull_request_review_id":2588528686,"id":1938467254,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5ziqm2","diff_hunk":"@@ -3562,8 +3562,7 @@ void DisplayServerX11::_handle_key_event(WindowID p_window, XKeyEvent *p_event,\n \t// XLookupString returns keysyms usable as nice keycodes.\n \tchar str[256] = {};\n \tXKeyEvent xkeyevent_no_mod = *xkeyevent;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ShiftMask;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ControlMask;\n+\txkeyevent_no_mod.state = 0;","path":"platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp","commit_id":"140a63be25cbcf0abdc363be3a3e52ea2bf05e9c","original_commit_id":"510f03f9e7ad63484ce4903a805eb43db23965f1","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This change completely breaks some layouts. Try DVORAK, it will return QWERTY key codes and Russian labels (picking it from a previous layout I guess, since DVORAK has bit 13 set in the state, which is group id).\r\n\r\nFor the reference: keyboard layouts config used to test:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot From 2025-02-02 13-21-30](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/705d1d00-1a22-43ea-8af8-bb43f2cccb2e)\r\n\r\n> A State Field from an XKB State\r\n> \r\n> Many events report the keyboard state in a single state field. Using XKB, a state field combines modifiers, group and the pointer button state into a single sixteen bit value as follows:\r\n> \r\n>    Bits 0 through 7 (the least significant eight bits) of the effective state comprise a mask of type KEYMASK which reports the state modifiers.\r\n>\r\n>    Bits 8 through 12 comprise a mask of type BUTMASK which reports pointer button state.\r\n>\r\n>    Bits 13 and 14 are interpreted as a two-bit unsigned numeric value and report the state keyboard group.\r\n>\r\n>    Bit 15 (the most significant bit) is reserved and must be zero.\r\n\r\nI guess we only want to unset modifier bits, not all of it, like:\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= 0xFF00;\r\n```","created_at":"2025-02-02T11:23:37Z","updated_at":"2025-02-02T11:24:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r1938467254","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938467254"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r1938467254"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938467254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":3565,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/1938533078","pull_request_review_id":2588593376,"id":1938533078,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5zi6rW","diff_hunk":"@@ -3562,8 +3562,7 @@ void DisplayServerX11::_handle_key_event(WindowID p_window, XKeyEvent *p_event,\n \t// XLookupString returns keysyms usable as nice keycodes.\n \tchar str[256] = {};\n \tXKeyEvent xkeyevent_no_mod = *xkeyevent;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ShiftMask;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ControlMask;\n+\txkeyevent_no_mod.state = 0;","path":"platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp","commit_id":"140a63be25cbcf0abdc363be3a3e52ea2bf05e9c","original_commit_id":"510f03f9e7ad63484ce4903a805eb43db23965f1","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"great catch! I had trouble finding any documentation for the state field so I just randomly printed it and tried to guess what happened :sweat_smile:.\r\n\r\nYes, my intent was to only unset modifier bits. You confirm that this change fixes other layouts, right?","created_at":"2025-02-02T16:48:54Z","updated_at":"2025-02-02T16:48:54Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r1938533078","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine