nEdit: Let me be more precise: Numpad and such is working, but moving my cursor with the Mod4 + esdf combination (where you see the arrows in the layout picture, close to wasd) and similar combinations (delete/return, esc, backspace, pg up/down, basically the whole left side)  no longer work.","created_at":"2025-03-20T23:52:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T23:56:26Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r2006622007","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2006622007"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r2006622007"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2006622007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":3565,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1938467254,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":6,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2006692021","pull_request_review_id":2704486947,"id":2006692021,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc53m7C1","diff_hunk":"@@ -3562,8 +3562,7 @@ void DisplayServerX11::_handle_key_event(WindowID p_window, XKeyEvent *p_event,\n \t// XLookupString returns keysyms usable as nice keycodes.\n \tchar str[256] = {};\n \tXKeyEvent xkeyevent_no_mod = *xkeyevent;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ShiftMask;\n-\txkeyevent_no_mod.state &= ~ControlMask;\n+\txkeyevent_no_mod.state = 0;","path":"platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp","commit_id":"140a63be25cbcf0abdc363be3a3e52ea2bf05e9c","original_commit_id":"510f03f9e7ad63484ce4903a805eb43db23965f1","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Hi, thank you for reporting this! I was worried that something like this could have happened and I tried to mitigate it as best I could; Unfortunately there run some deeper issues and I chose a middle ground in this PR.\r\n\r\nI later opened PR #102641 (Wayland only because I know that best), which got merged, that tries to workaround the issue fully. Can you replicate this issue with the latest build of Godot (4.4 stable is fine) on the [Wayland backend](https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-3-dev-3/#wayland-support-for-linux)? If it works, all we might need is to port it to the X11 backend.\r\n\r\nWhatever the outcome of the above steps is, I'd appreciate if you could file a new issue ticket, as I think this is something that we should keep track of anyways.","created_at":"2025-03-21T01:13:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T01:13:50Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102169#discussion_r2006692021","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102169","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/commen